        <mxCell id="msg23" value="Customer and Order → SERVED; servedTurn recorded. No eating completion on the serving turn. VIP satisfaction is now 90 (VIP-first) or 85 (C1-first); served customers no longer lose waiting satisfaction." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
