        <mxCell id="msg2" value="Each turn: scheduled factory arrival → showTurnStart → Waiter choice/retry → showActionState → Chef choice/retry → advanceEating → oldestEligiblePayer → optional collectPayment → applyWaitingLoss → showActionState → showTurnEnd. Arrivals: 1,4,7,10,13,16; IDs=(turn-1)/3+1. Main maps C2 VIP, C3 Critic, others Regular." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
